{"version": 2, "width": 78, "height": 66, "timestamp": 1787842134, "idle_time_limit": 2.0, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/zsh", "TERM": null}}
[0.044715, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.40215, "o", "  ONE DEPOT, ONE NIGHT, THREE SETTLEMENTS\r\n"]
[0.531644, "o", "  depot-north — 18 vans on a congestion-constrained connection\r\n"]
[0.661574, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.022321, "o", "ACT 1  the meter reports\r\n"]
[1.932246, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[2.0587, "o", "  02:00: 22 kW   register 105500 Wh\r\n"]
[2.185267, "o", "  02:15: 22 kW   register 111000 Wh\r\n"]
[2.316315, "o", "  02:30: 22 kW   register 116500 Wh\r\n"]
[2.44239, "o", "  02:45: 22 kW   register 122000 Wh\r\n"]
[2.567257, "o", "  03:00: 22 kW   register 127500 Wh\r\n"]
[2.693527, "o", "  03:15: 15 kW   register 131250 Wh\r\n"]
[2.821174, "o", "  03:30: 15 kW   register 135000 Wh\r\n"]
[2.947131, "o", "  03:45: 15 kW   register 138750 Wh\r\n"]
[3.074947, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.432249, "o", "  every reading signed by the charge point's own key, verifiable\r\n"]
[3.561039, "o", "  offline by anyone holding the platform's public key\r\n"]
[3.689855, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.048026, "o", "ACT 2  the aggregator asks to curtail\r\n"]
[4.955679, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[5.08439, "o", "  03:14: curtail depot-north-cp-04 from 22 kW to 7 kW for 40 minutes\r\n"]
[5.210251, "o", "\r\n"]
[5.568067, "o", "  no capability: REFUSED — malformed capability token\r\n"]
[5.695615, "o", "  wrong issuer: REFUSED — capability token signature is not valid for this issuer\r\n"]
[5.825305, "o", "  the real capability: held for review — shed of 15000W is at or above the review threshold of 11000W\r\n"]
[5.955104, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.312736, "o", "  15 kW is within the 15 kW granted but past the 11 kW review threshold,\r\n"]
[6.44228, "o", "  and no operator is wired in — so the command is NOT dispatched.\r\n"]
[6.564697, "o", "  Nothing reached the charge point. The refusal is on the record.\r\n"]
[6.690243, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.051848, "o", "  re-presented, 7 kW shed: allowed\r\n"]
[7.181777, "o", "  03:14: SetChargingProfile dispatched, hung under the authority that permitted it\r\n"]
[7.31266, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.666735, "o", "ACT 3  morning — three settlements, one chain\r\n"]
[8.571335, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[8.69575, "o", "  energy bill: 38 kWh   EUR 10.64\r\n"]
[8.822755, "o", "  flexibility payment: 4 kWh   EUR 0.48\r\n"]
[8.946477, "o", "  baseline used: 22 kW, metered 15 kW\r\n"]
[9.070049, "o", "  method: nominated baseline  fingerprint e19ee448668d7b77\r\n"]
[9.193393, "o", "\r\n"]
[9.55051, "o", "  both derive from the same signed readings. Walking up from either:\r\n"]
[9.677794, "o", "\r\n"]
[10.03366, "o", "    settlement.flex\r\n"]
[10.160889, "o", "    curtail.applied\r\n"]
[10.284646, "o", "    grid.allowed\r\n"]
[10.411828, "o", "    grid.intent\r\n"]
[10.534806, "o", "    curtail.command\r\n"]
[10.659782, "o", "    meter.reading\r\n"]
[10.784884, "o", "\r\n"]
[11.142035, "o", "ACT 4  somebody edits a meter value\r\n"]
[12.049099, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[12.176364, "o", "  edit: 03:15 register 131250 Wh -> 134750 Wh   (+3.5 kWh of flexibility, worth EUR 0.42)\r\n"]
[12.302241, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.659595, "o", "  result: signature check fails at 03:15 — that reading, and only that reading\r\n"]
[12.786714, "o", "\r\n"]
[13.144096, "o", "  the edit did not need to be guessed at. Every other reading still\r\n"]
[13.271296, "o", "  verifies, so the chain names the one that does not.\r\n"]
[13.398675, "o", "\r\n"]
[13.756477, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[13.884146, "o", "  Every settlement above walks back to a signed meter reading,\r\n"]
[14.011589, "o", "  through the capability that authorised the command that changed it.\r\n"]
[14.142723, "o", "  A command without that authority never reached the charge point.\r\n"]
[14.271355, "o", "\r\n"]
[14.629371, "o", "  The baseline remains a model. This makes the flexibility claim\r\n"]
[14.756815, "o", "  checkable and replayable by any party — not true.\r\n"]
[14.884349, "o", "\r\n"]
